          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Leakage Kalibrasi GBDT (Train NLL=0.0018) ===\n1. Raw GBDT (Tanpa Kalibrasi)      | Test Brier=0.1037 | Test NLL=0.4282 | Test ECE=0.0668\n2. LEAKY Isotonic di X_train       | Test Brier=0.1048 | Test NLL=0.7069 | Test ECE=0.0726\n3. SAFE Isotonic (Held-Out)        | Test Brier=0.0992 | Test NLL=0.3353 | Test ECE=0.0256\n4. SAFE Platt/Sigmoid (Held-Out)   | Test Brier=0.0995 | Test NLL=0.3326 | Test ECE=0.0361",
