          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `temperature_scale_logits(logits_cal, y_cal, logits_test, y_test)` menggunakan NumPy dan `scipy.optimize.minimize_scalar(..., bounds=(0.1, 10.0), method='bounded')` untuk mencari suhu optimal $T^*$ yang meminimalkan *multiclass Negative Log-Likelihood* stabil secara numerik (kurangi nilai maksimum per baris sebelum `np.exp`) pada `(logits_cal, y_cal)`. Evaluasi `nll_before` ($T=1$) dan `nll_after` ($T=T^*$) pada set uji serta periksa apakah vektor `argmax` 100% identik (`same_argmax`). Kembalikan `(round(T_opt, 4), round(nll_before, 4), round(nll_after, 4), same_argmax)`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize_scalar\n\ndef temperature_scale_logits(logits_cal, y_cal, logits_test, y_test) -> tuple[float, float, float, bool]:\n    # TODO: tulis fungsi NLL stabil log-sum-exp -> optimasi T* di [0.1, 10.0] -> hitung nll_before, nll_after, same_argmax\n    pass\n\nlc_ex2 = [[5.0, 0.5, -1.0], [0.2, 4.8, -0.5], [-1.0, 4.5, 0.4], [4.2, 3.8, -1.0], [-0.5, 0.2, 5.2], [2.5, 4.4, -0.8]]\nyc_ex2 = [0, 1, 0, 1, 2, 0]\nlt_ex2 = [[4.6, 0.4, -0.8], [0.1, 4.4, 0.2], [0.5, 4.6, -1.2], [-0.4, 0.5, 4.9]]\nyt_ex2 = [0, 1, 0, 2]\nprint(temperature_scale_logits(lc_ex2, yc_ex2, lt_ex2, yt_ex2))",
