          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef cqr_calibrate_and_evaluate(q_lo_cal, q_hi_cal, y_cal, q_lo_test, q_hi_test, y_test, alpha: float = 0.20) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n    # TODO: hitung signed scores E_i -> finite-sample q_hat -> raw_cov, cqr_cov, avg_width\n    pass\n\nqlc4 = [8.0, 10.0, 14.0, 18.0, 20.0, 24.0, 28.0, 30.0, 35.0]\nqhc4 = [10.0, 13.0, 17.0, 22.0, 25.0, 30.0, 35.0, 39.0, 46.0]\nyc4 = [9.2, 13.4, 13.2, 20.5, 26.2, 23.0, 36.8, 34.0, 48.5]\nqlt4 = [9.0, 15.0, 22.0, 31.0, 38.0]\nqht4 = [11.0, 19.0, 28.0, 40.0, 50.0]\nyt4 = [9.8, 20.1, 20.8, 41.2, 53.0]\nprint(cqr_calibrate_and_evaluate(qlc4, qhc4, yc4, qlt4, qht4, yt4, alpha=0.20))",
